ont (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))) (property "Assembly" "HAND_THT" (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))) (property "DesignNote" "Crystal load, C0G" (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))) (pin "1" (uuid "504e3824-596e-5f68-8a4f-3c3a6bd27ce8")) (pin "2" (uuid "d33fedab-9bf0-5292-84d4-48da8c62cc2d")) (instances (project "kenwood_proxy" (path "/4922d4c6-9842-5666-9f3f-f015399c8583/6463564e-b445-5ffa-8d80-8c701966980b" (reference "C8") (unit 1))))) (text "Pin plan (AVR128DB28 SPDIP): USART0 PA1 RX <- TAP_BODY, PA0 TX -> DBG_TX (both at radio baud).\nUSART1 PC1 RX <- TAP_HEAD, PC0 TX -> HEAD_TX_MCU (proxy output to head). PD1 ILL_SENSE (low = lights on).\nAll other I/O unconnected (PA2-PA7, PC2-PC3, PD2-PD7); enable their internal pull-ups or disable input buffers. PF0/PF1 crystal.\nOSCHF accuracy is only +/-5% below 0 C without the crystal: enable XOSC32K auto-tune before using UARTs.\nSuggested clock 10 or 20 MHz (harmonics clear of 144-148 MHz). VDDIO2 tied to +5 V. RESET left on internal pull-up." (at 15.24 241.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7f7d1553-5131-5aee-940c-e64f44885373")) (embedded_fonts no))
